digraph account_payable_process_121 {
	graph [rankdir=LR]
	START_NODE [label="" shape=circle width=0.3]
	subgraph CLUSTER_0 {
		"enter purchase order details" [shape=box]
		"create a receiving report" [shape=box]
		"enter purchase order details" -> "create a receiving report"
		"confirm all documents have been amended" [shape=box]
		"create a receiving report" -> "confirm all documents have been amended"
		"AND_SPLIT--4. Payment_3NSE" [label="+" fixedsize=true shape=diamond width=0.5]
		"confirm all documents have been amended" -> "AND_SPLIT--4. Payment_3NSE"
		"enter the invoice into the accounts payable account" [shape=box]
		"AND_SPLIT--4. Payment_3NSE" -> "enter the invoice into the accounts payable account"
		"store in paid invoice file" [shape=box]
		"AND_SPLIT--4. Payment_3NSE" -> "store in paid invoice file"
		"stamp all documents" [shape=box]
		"enter the invoice into the accounts payable account" -> "stamp all documents"
		"AND_JOIN--4. Payment_3NSE" [label="+" fixedsize=true shape=diamond width=0.5]
		"stamp all documents" -> "AND_JOIN--4. Payment_3NSE"
		"store in paid invoice file" -> "AND_JOIN--4. Payment_3NSE"
	}
	START_NODE -> "enter purchase order details"
	END_NODE [label="" shape=doublecircle width=0.2]
	"AND_JOIN--4. Payment_3NSE" -> END_NODE
	fontsize=15 label="\n\n
The following text is about the account payable process. It begins when you enter purchase order details. 
After entering purchase order details, creating a receiving report needs to be done. 
After creating a receiving report, you need to confirm all documents have been amended.
When confirming all documents have been amended is completed, the process is split into 2 parallel branches: entering the invoice into the accounts payable account and storing in paid invoice file. 
When entering the invoice into the accounts payable account is completed, stamping all documents needs to be done. 
The process is now completed. 
"
	fontsize=15 label="\n\n
The following text is about the invoice process - it starts when you enter Purchase Order details.
After entering the purchase order details, a receiving report needs to be done.
After creating a receipt report, you need to confirm that all documents have been amended.
When the confirmation of all documents have been amended is completed, the process is split into 2 parallel branches : the entering the invoice into the accounts payable account and the storing in the paid invoice file.
When the invoice is entered into the account payable, all documents need to be stamped.
The process is now complete.
"
}
